.TH AVR\-VM\-USAGE 1 "" "avr 0.1.6" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-vm-usage \- Show usage metering (runtime / vCPU / memory seconds) per VM.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr vm usage
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show usage metering (runtime / vCPU / memory seconds) per VM.
.PP
Each power-on cycle's window is clipped to the requested period and summed. Deleted VMs are included: usage survives deletion.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-start\fR \fIDATETIME\fR
Inclusive period start (default: 30 days ago).
.TP
\fB\-\-end\fR \fIDATETIME\fR
Exclusive period end (default: now).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the usage report as JSON.
